# =============================================================================
# FKS Trading System — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env and fill in your values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Generate secrets with:
#   openssl rand -base64 32   # for passwords / session secrets
#   openssl rand -hex 32      # for tokens / API keys
#
# Or use the helper script:
#   ./run.sh setup-env
#
# ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │  SECRET MANAGEMENT PHILOSOPHY                                          │
# │                                                                        │
# │  • SERVICE SECRETS (Postgres, Redis, Grafana, session keys, etc.)      │
# │    → Auto-generated by ./run.sh setup-env — never leave the server.    │
# │    → Stored ONLY in .env — never committed to git.                     │
# │                                                                        │
# │  • EXTERNAL API KEYS (Kraken, Rithmic, Massive, xAI, TV, etc.)        │
# │    → Stored encrypted in Postgres via Settings → API Keys in WebUI.    │
# │    → key_manager resolves: encrypted DB → env var → None (graceful).   │
# │    → Env vars below are fallbacks — prefer the WebUI for management.   │
# │                                                                        │
# │  • CI/CD SECRETS (Tailscale, SSH, Docker Hub, Discord)                 │
# │    → Set in GitHub repo Settings → Secrets — not in .env.              │
# └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# Port map (all bound to 127.0.0.1 — reachable via localhost / Tailscale):
#   80     nginx              3001   webui (SvelteKit)
#   5432   postgres           3000   grafana
#   6379   redis              9090   prometheus
#   7000   janus HTTP         9093   alertmanager
#   7001   janus forward      16686  jaeger UI
#   8090   bot spawner        9000   questdb console
#   8812   questdb pg wire    9091   demo bot (--profile demo)
#   9009   questdb ILP        3100   loki
#   6333   qdrant REST
#   6334   qdrant gRPC
# =============================================================================


